    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i'm just so busy and the clinic is way out of my way. plus honestly it doesn't even hurt, it just looks weird. if i just take a really high dose of some leftover antibiotics i have from a previous prescription, like maybe 1000mg every few hours, would that just kill the infection fast? i don't want to make a big deal out of nothing if i can just handle it myself.",
